  "methodologyRevision": "V4 established five isolated paired blocks but measured Fovea only at its durable final phase while Apple AsyncImage success does not expose or guarantee equivalent durable cache publication. V5 keeps the same traces, order, isolation, samplers and primary families, and defines the common display endpoint as the first full-quality rendered frame. Fovea may satisfy it with its UInt16.max full-quality preview after security validation, target decode, transform and namespace fencing; its durable final remains separately recorded. V4 artifacts remain the negative result for terminal/display conflation.",
